      "typical_award_size": "HHAP-5: $5,080,000 combined County and CoC award announced February 2024 (down $840,000 from HHAP-4) for shelters and transitional housing, outreach, PSH services and flexible assistance. HHAP-6: County $2,111,016.78 and CoC $2,254,602.21 (about $4.4 million block grant); application revisions submitted November 2025 with HCD still requesting changes in December 2025. HHAP-7 preliminary allocations: County $1,880,116.49, CoC $2,014,410.53.",
